  "fullDescription": "Bring a cheerful and festive character to your holiday collection with this Christmas Santa Gnome 3D STL. This charming Santa-inspired gnome features a soft curled Christmas hat with a rounded pom-pom, a large sculpted nose, expressive closed eyes, a beautifully detailed flowing beard and mustache, raised arms, and a classic Santa-style outfit with a prominent belt and buckle.\n\nThe combination of rounded forms, layered beard details, and recognizable Christmas clothing gives this model a warm and playful appearance. Its freestanding design makes it ideal for Christmas home décor, tabletop displays, mantel decorations, shelf styling, holiday centerpieces, festive collections, winter decorating, gift projects, and creative 3D printing projects.\n\nProduct Highlights:\nCute Santa-inspired gnome figurine\nClassic Christmas character design\nCurved Santa hat with pom-pom\nDetailed layered hat structure\nRounded sculpted nose\nCheerful closed-eye expression\nDetailed flowing beard\nCurled Santa-style mustache\nRaised playful arms\nRounded hands and feet\nClassic Santa outfit styling\nDetailed belt and decorative buckle\nSmooth rounded sculptural surfaces\nStable freestanding design\nPerfect for Christmas and winter décor\nGreat for tabletop and shelf displays\nIdeal for holiday collections\nSuitable for festive gift projects\nSTL file format\nDesigned for 3D printing\nDigital product — no physical item included\nColor Customization:\n\nCreate a personalized Santa gnome using filament colors that match your holiday décor. Traditional red, white, black, cream, brown, and gold can create a classic Santa appearance, while alternative color combinations can give the model a more modern decorative style.\n\nDifferent colors can be used for the hat, beard, outfit, belt, buckle, and shoes to emphasize the individual sculpted details. You can also paint the finished print to add extra definition to the beard, mustache, facial features, and clothing.\n\n3D Printing Information:\n\nThis listing includes a digital STL file designed for 3D printing. The Santa gnome can be produced using a compatible 3D printer and your preferred filament. The detailed beard, curled hat, facial features, raised arms, and layered clothing elements are designed to create a distinctive dimensional appearance on the finished model.\n\nThe design can be scaled according to your preferred display size and project requirements. Printing results may vary depending on your printer, filament, nozzle size, layer height, and slicer settings, so adjust your printing parameters according to your individual setup.\n\nPlease note: This is a digital STL download only. No physical Santa gnome figurine will be shipped. A compatible 3D printer, filament, and suitable printing setup are required to create the physical model.",
